menu "Brain Block Configuration"

    config DEBUG_JSON_FORMATTED
        bool "Enable formatted JSON output for debugging"
        default n
        help
            When enabled, JSON output will be formatted with indentation and newlines,
            making it easier to read in logs during development and debugging.
            When disabled (default), JSON output is compact/unformatted to reduce
            message size over the network.
            
            Enable this option for development/debugging purposes.
            Disable for production to optimize network bandwidth.

endmenu
